{"4380100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duball Dash", "steam_appid": 4380100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey — I wanted to make a game you can just <i>jump into</i> and have fun with right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duball Dash</strong> is a simple, hyper-casual endless runner set inside a fast-moving tube. You play as a green ball with some seriously cool white ski goggles, rolling forward and dodging metal walls with black-and-yellow hazard tape, plus plenty of red cylinders trying to ruin your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>10 lives every run</strong>. That’s on purpose. I want you to experiment, mess up, learn the patterns, and keep going — without feeling punished for every mistake. This isn’t a rage-quit game. It’s more of a “one more try” game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art style is intentionally playful and a bit silly — like something drawn in Paint — because the game doesn’t take itself too seriously. It’s kid-friendly, fast, and all about improving your run little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like quick games, endless runners, and chill trial-and-error gameplay, I think you’ll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll fast. Crash. Laugh. Try again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Move left and right using <strong>A &amp; D</strong> or the <strong>Left &amp; Right Arrow keys</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey — I wanted to make a game you can just <i>jump into</i> and have fun with right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duball Dash</strong> is a simple, hyper-casual endless runner set inside a fast-moving tube. You play as a green ball with some seriously cool white ski goggles, rolling forward and dodging metal walls with black-and-yellow hazard tape, plus plenty of red cylinders trying to ruin your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/9b50ac2ac67c1c59215755408c002865.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>10 lives every run</strong>. That’s on purpose. I want you to experiment, mess up, learn the patterns, and keep going — without feeling punished for every mistake. This isn’t a rage-quit game. It’s more of a “one more try” game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/dc1677ec589dd3a85d0fb47300f00d26.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art style is intentionally playful and a bit silly — like something drawn in Paint — because the game doesn’t take itself too seriously. It’s kid-friendly, fast, and all about improving your run little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like quick games, endless runners, and chill trial-and-error gameplay, I think you’ll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.poster.avif?t=1780313691\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.webm?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/extras/f51a2ff5527ff2a91a875f779b73cf02.mp4?t=1780313691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll fast. Crash. Laugh. Try again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Move left and right using <strong>A &amp; D</strong> or the <strong>Left &amp; Right Arrow keys</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Roll fast, crash often, and keep dashing—Duball Dash is endless hyper-casual fun inside the tube. Roll fast as a cool green ball rocking swag white ski goggles, dodge metal walls with black-and-yellow hazard tape, and slip past bouncing red cylinders as the speed ramps up.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/180f3aa022cddd022fc0aa74d14a94c5a12541d2/header.jpg?t=1780313691", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/cbc6a30728af2b732d3dd50548d42fc324458993/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780313691", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380100/cbc6a30728af2b732d3dd50548d42fc324458993/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780313691", "website":